#38300
The Cleric's Guild of Samsera~
The Cleric's Guild a large, fortified church in the north-west most corner
of Samsera's Guild Square is home to the healing class.
I'll be separating the good aligned from the evil aligned clerics 
in this guild to a point and putting an emphasis on Prayer, not magic.

the Guild's features include:
A Guild Guard
A Vault for valuables and magical artifacts
A training room
multiple spell practice rooms
A Main regeneration Room
A shopkeeper
2 boards, one general, one as a Trial for the HighPriest.
Two Challenge Rooms - Protect Oneself, and Protect Another.

Kurse, Sep 00'
~
