#38301
The Lobby of the Grand Church~
   You step into the main lobby of the church, obviously crafted to awe and
inspire those lucky enough to be welcomed into the guild.  The ceiling here is
domed and made of a colorful stained glass mural depicting the infinite
struggle between the gods of evil and the gods of good.  Between them stands
the gods of neutrality.  Lush paintings of obvious cost and golden, onyx, and
jade sculptures decorate the walls and floors.  A diagram of the guild,
depicting its large size is set into a bronze plate in the floor.    
~
