#38302
The Gathering of Faiths~
   The Guild of Clerics are very unified throughout the realms, so much so that
they are persecuted near as much as the Solamnic Knights in their faith and
cohesiveness.  While clerics follow different deities and quite often
principles, these are lain aside for the greater glory of the guild itself.  
It is true that there are those dark clerics who make no attempt to disguise
their hatred for the gods of good, and clerics of light who vow to smite the
darkness.  But while in this place, the Guild of Clerics takes precedence so
that it may flourish in splendor instead of discord.
~
