#38303
The unholy way~
   This dark hallway spirals downwards towards a large chamber from which you
hear a low chanting.  The walls are decorated with paintings of many of the
gods of evil such as Takhisis, Chemosh, Morgion, and the dead King Xerxes.  As
well it seems evident that there may be worship of some of the most powerful of
demons and devils, as Orcus, Demogorgon, and the Overlord of the Nine Hells are
depicted here in artistic rendition.    
~
