#38304
The Twisted Sanctuary~
   The stairs lead down to a large expansive room, a massive sanctuary
dedicated to the gods of evil and the black arts.  Macabre idols and sculptures
of ebony and jade decorate the sanctum, all adding to its unholy appearance.  
Many dark priests are gathered here, preparing for a ritual sacrifice of some
type.    
