#38305
The Vault of Tithes~
   As a service to their Guild and Church, each Cleric is obliged to give ten
percent of all gold they acquire each month to the church.  This vault, built
by a famous dwarven healer, was made for that purpose in particular.  But as
well, it now serves as a vault for special items and artifacts acquired abroad.
The chamber is made of sturdy granite and is filled with many baubles and gold.
It is expected that Clerics will donate to the vault as freely as they take
from it.    
~
