The Training Chapel~
   This smaller chapel is where clerics receive their schooling into the art
and skill of prayers and devotions.  A central podium stands near the front of
the room in front of row after ro of wooden pews.  Many clerics are seated here
studying, heads bowed in silent concentration.    
