#38308
A Rounded Room~
   You step through the door from the training chapel into this rounded room
with shining marble floors of black and white.  Be silent, for many clerics are
in deep concentration or prayer in this wing of the guild.  To the north lies
the ill-famed 'brewing chamber', where Gnomish clerics go to practice brewing
potions without fear of destroying the church.  To the east and south are
separate prayer rooms for clerics to practice their skills in.    
~
