#38309
A Prayer Room~
   You step into another small chamber used by clerics of the guild to practice
the art of prayer to their Gods, forming a stronger link between them and their
deity.  The room is rather lavish, being decorated with small figurines of
jade, gold, and onyx.  All clerics use these rooms, regardless of the alignment
they follow.    
