#38310
The Prayer Room~
   The walls of this small room are covered in ornate designs of ivory and
ebony.  Quite wisely, the crafter used a dense resin to adhere the designs to
the wall that absorbs vibration, rending this room virtually soundproof.  
These prayer rooms are scattered all about the guild, and serve as a place for
clerics to come and concentrate in prayer to their God and practice.    
~
