#38311
The Brewing Chamber~
   This middle sized room is occupied by a central worktable of stone and a
large shelf unit to the side.  The shelfing contains many glass bottles and
ampules, as well as hundreds of herbal and non-herbal ingredients.  The
worktable itself is surface to a number of mortars and pestles, odd mazes of
glass tubing, and prayer books.  This is where, through the science of alchemy
and magic of prayer, gnomes brew magic potions.  It is as you think about
gnomes that you notice the floor is scored in many places by explosions.    
~
