#38312
The Grand Altar and Cathedral~
   Without doubt the largest room in the guild, the grand cathedral is the
ultimate sanctum of prayer.  Towering windows of stained glass occupy the east
wall and send colored beams of light throughout the chamber.  Decorated so
intricately it is hard to describe, the grand cathedral serves as home to All
clerics of the realms.  So strong is the faith in this room, be it good, evil,
or neutral, it is said that physical and spiritual strength is gained at a
divinely accellerated rate here.    
~
