#38314
The Trial of the HighPriest~
   A reknowned position within the Guild is the HighPriest, a cleric of
inspiring faith, wisdom, and power.  Though the HighPriest may be chosen twice
a month, the trials the cleric must undergo to attain the mantle are rigorous
and fraught with danger.  This ornate room serves as the staging point for the
Trial, and is where new clerics are nominated to challenge for the position
each month.    
~
