#38315
The Test of Faith~
   Prayer and faith are powerful weapons, as they alone have been known to win
battles, even wars.  Such faith and the power of prayer is the pillar of a
cleric's ability.  It is in this room that the greater faith and connection to
their god is determined.  A central altar occupies the room.  Here, each Cleric
prays in turn to the gods for a sign.  Whichever cleric receives the greater
sign, or sign at all, is one step closer to becoming HighPriest or
HighPriestess.    
~
