#38316
Protect Thyself~
   You enter a small room with a single squared arena in its center.  At either
end of the arena is a small altar for clerics to pray to their gods before
battle.  This trial pits cleric against cleric in battle, with only their
weapon, their faith, and their prayers to keep them alive.  Whoever proves
victorius shall be one step closer to attaining the title of HighPriest or
HighPriestess.    
~
