#38317
Protect Another~
   The last of the Trials involves a cleric's ability to protect another.  In
this test, each Cleric must sustain a fighter for as long as possible against
one of the two werewolves.  Whichever cleric keeps the fighter alive or from
fleeing the longest, is considered victorious.    
